Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:21.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are just four level 45 brats, kill them alrady
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you seen kids who leveled up to 45?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dont' be fooled by the randomized appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, finish, them, the turf war is starting soon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uncle, please let us go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'M NOT AN UNCLE!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:37.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let them go, they are all level 45, obviously the're doing the treshold quest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:38.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meow~ (Just focus on running)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.89,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,One of us is their target
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:41.02,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Although they're not high leveled, we must get rid of them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:39.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:41.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did I understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So who's gonna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:44.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awen, you do it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:53.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Focus on running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:36.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Protect me! I need to channel for 5 seconds!\NWe have one more warp left!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:42.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starting now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:44.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's not enogh time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:56.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interrupt them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:00.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:02.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We only warped for 2km
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:03.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:04.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we log out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:07.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we need to wait two minutes post combat to do that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:18.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got em! They're here!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try to evade! Do not engage in combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:39.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coordinates
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:49.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's "Pursuit"! We can't leave battle for at least 10 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's unrealistic to log out now! We need to counter attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:52.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there, the geography is complex
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:02.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't those brats kill us earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.52,0:03:03.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn, they were looking down on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our target is among those four, I leave it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:34.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get them!! Don't let them escape!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Retreat!! Those under level 60 retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's hnting us down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:38.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happening!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:40.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Healer!! Stall them!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:41.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heal what! They are all one-hit KOed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:46.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mission Complete!!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:53.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leveled up again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we level up like this on the go, they shouldn't be a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:13.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:14.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,BROTHER!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:17.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lv 145?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is such a high end player here!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:25.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:28.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hopefully there won't be any others...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:04.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't she die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:06.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:14.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over Lv100?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:26.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These guys are all above Lv100!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:29.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:48.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:26.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:29.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:36.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop th chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:37.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.31,0:07:40.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The "pursuit" is on him, he won't be able to leave combat for 20minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:43.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good, open the gates to the warded zone for the entire team!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:46.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this necessary? The turf war is starting soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:49.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we join the turf war now, the ending is suspenseless
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:51.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the fun in that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:53.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is obviously much more interestin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:55.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even you can't beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:59.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If not for this special equipment, I would be dead hundreds of times already
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:02.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if so, non of us are safe then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:04.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we play this game to be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:06.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But.. Then again..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:09.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he does manage to defeat all seven of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:13.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'd be the highest level player on the server
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:32.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The precision to your "pursuit" skill is so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:34.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has a hundred metres range, what'd you expect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:36.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't find him like this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:39.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup, he's on the tree
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:42.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can't leave the locale right now, he must be agitated
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:45.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is very fast, and the warded zone lasts only 30 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:49.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When the ward dessipates, we probably can't catch him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His speed is not comparable to us, be he is super agile
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't catch him in the woods, but he can't get away on the plains
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:08:58.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When the time comes I'll be tha thank
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:00.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liusan, Launbu, XIaorui
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:02.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You three are in charge of locking him down
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:04.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geshao, Axian, Tuobi
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You three slow down the area
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:08.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For safe measure, apply 3 stacks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:10.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spare no expense
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why can't he leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is hit by a tracking skill, it says so in his status
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:18.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,18 minutes of it left. Plus they used a warding item
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:21.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can't leave the zone for half an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:23.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei doesn't know how to read the skills menu right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:27.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,yeah, if he can elude capture, then he can log out in 18 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.99,0:09:30.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I go tell him that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:33.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we cannot reach him from outside the game
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:35.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't help, it is all up to him now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:39.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there is an advantage right now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:42.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are not sharing exp
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:44.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He will level up very quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:47.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did we kill all his teammates?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:49.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't know the situation would be like this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:50.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we killed as many as we could
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:55.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of us can die, or else he will become too powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:56.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All set?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:58.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more minute
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:10:00.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seven lvl 100+ ganging on a lvl 50
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:01.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we really need to be this careful
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:05.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What type of special equipment does he have? So curious
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:08.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it is something that raises the reaction speed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:12.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who doesn't have a few of these items
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:14.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His maneuvers are what is most important
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:17.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we finally catch him...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:20.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll add him as a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.27,0:10:20.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.71,0:10:28.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't get out... And can't log out...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:40.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are afraid that I'll level up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These lowe leveled players are not threat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:43.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since I can't run
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:44.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll counter attack
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:53.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! That is a rare item! Use it sparingly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, this is but the distracction
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:02.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a bit more
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:07.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got him
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:12.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did Xiaohei get hit by?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.51,0:11:14.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dunno, can't tell if anything is wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.59,0:11:18.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:22.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I level up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:00.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:01.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't taht guy defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:04.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a passive ability, the oponent will receive an ailment if he is killed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:06.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now it seems that weight is added
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:08.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Xiaohei leveling up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:28.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry! We have only 5 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:46.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never imagine that guy could revive, how could that skill exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:49.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is Xiaohei still not leveling up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:51.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did they mean by they have have only 5 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:57.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:12:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:16.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:18.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't face him head on! Remember to heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.47,0:13:22.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dont' let him lead! Slow him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:31.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heal! Chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:52.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:53.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's gone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:54.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:55.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is trouble now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:59.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is nearby, we won't warp far with his abilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:00.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careful everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:03.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must have been hit by an level supressing skill
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:05.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A skill like that exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:10.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He should have gained the exp, he can't level up for a period of time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:13.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What they said earlier, it was probably the time limit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:15.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Xiaohei can hang on until then
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:16.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll level up like crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:41.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careful! He has assassination weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:02.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's on the move
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't chase!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:25.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,, Heal, slow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:28.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're very strong
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:30.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Add me as a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:36.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more minute until time is up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:41.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kill him then, it will be tragic if he kills us later instead
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:47.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope we get the chance to meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:02.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mast...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:05.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shifu (master)......
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:07.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:08.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You failed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:53.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm taking this one with me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:54.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lvl. 13?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:55.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:57.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kill them first, then talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:05.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:10.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.81,0:19:15.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking him, but I'll give you this item as compensation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:17.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll definitely like it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:28.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The damage is so low......
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:31.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't even lose HP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:33.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that metal pallet a speccialized item?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:37.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:38.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So eager
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.77,0:19:39.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then don't look
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.25,0:19:40.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no I'll lok
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:43.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is it dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:46.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It probably got turned off
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:49.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That personal just now, so that's Xiaohei Shifu......
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:55.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They shut us out. I really want to know what they're saying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:57.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey......
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:18.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the game fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:24.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When completing the mission, were you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.61,0:20:29.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:33.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this were a real mission, they'd all be acutally dead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.93,0:20:39.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I don't know anything, I always depend of them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.33,0:20:41.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only know how to fight....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:44.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I still can't protect them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.97,0:20:48.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you are excellent at fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:49.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:53.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your joy, it's not from the mission, but from spending time with friends right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:59.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your wish to beome an Executor, is only so that you can stay with Shifu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.73,0:21:07.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This mission, was set by me, I considered the chance that you won't finish it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.57,0:21:11.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I didn't think you would fail this early
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't get to experience how difficult are the later questlines
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:19.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this is the daily life of an Executor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:25.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is Shifu happy when doing mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:26.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.09,0:21:28.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why do you do them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:30.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:32.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I can do it cause of responsibilty too
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:38.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now the guild is very strong,\Nthere is no need for kids like you to take responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:43.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what do you really wish to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:49.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Upon hearing the question, what is the first thought in your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.49,0:22:04.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I......
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.53,0:22:07.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to go to school with Xiaobai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:12.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Superb, then that's it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.85,0:22:17.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna......
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:20.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying? I will go there too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:22.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.85,0:22:27.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, just like before
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.25,0:22:32.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know? In a human home
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.61,0:22:36.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every child goes to school, while the adults work
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:40.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you're home from school, I'll be home too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:46.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You'll understand when you go to school
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.13,0:22:52.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When the day comes,\Nwhen you really want to be an Executor, you can take the test again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:54.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:22:56.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.85,0:22:59.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still not waking up~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:02.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've made many good friends
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:05.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Treasure them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.81,0:23:06.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.37,0:23:45.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it appears that he can fully control his new dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.01,0:23:48.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, he finally adjusted to it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:50.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:53.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dong Dong
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.09,0:24:54.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:25:04.42,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.42,0:25:09.16,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:13.86,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.86,0:25:20.06,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.06,0:25:26.21,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.21,0:25:31.01,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.01,0:25:35.69,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:42.21,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.21,0:25:53.53,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.53,0:25:58.95,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.95,0:26:03.99,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:15.22,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:20.77,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.77,0:26:27.61,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
